                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Got a free copy of the game from orlygift.com\n\nBlack Shell media is known for small minimum budget indie games that's not very good. \n\nBut they are however improving after every creation and getting better and better.\n\nFor example this game is very big upgrade from \"Terablaster\". \nBeing a top down bullet hell shooter it's not bad. \n\nThere are however many flaws in the game.. To name a few.. Getting hit pause the screen for 1/4 of a second and it feels really weird. The sound is very very basic and doesn't really fit the game. 30 second of minor enemy between each boss is way too quick and make you feel less satisfy of killing each of the boss.. Having 3+1 stage just feel short and cheap...\n\nAny how .. it's a improved indie bullet hell shooter. There are much better ones out there but this one is quite cheap so you can win from different giveaway for free or just spend 1 dollar to pick a copy for a few minutes of fun... \n\nBeing a Touhou Vetern I was able to blast though easy difficulty on first try and i have no doubt that i can do the same with normal and brutal as i learn each of the boss better... I will however stop playing this game because it's just way to simple.\n\nI will not recommend this game for the same reason.. too Simple! I do however encourage developer to keep on trying and one day make a game that's better and have more content.\n\n4/10 would be my final rating.\n",
